            (99.2 % purity) and five titanium foils (99.6 %
           purity), but instead of nickel foils, the second
           stack contained five iron foils (99.5 % purity). In
           addition, this stack consisted of seven 6,060
           aluminum alloy foils. The titanium, nickel and iron
           foils serve as monitor foils, while the zirconium
           foils are the foils of interest.
